 ```
+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+without changing either supplied document. Object members in the patch are merged recursively; a `null` member
+removes that member, while arrays and other JSON values replace the target value.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyMergePatch(
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", role: "admin" } },
+  { profile: { role: null }, enabled: true },
+); // { profile: { name: "Ada" }, enabled: true }
+```
